{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cfpf5CCHvkdkwZFnDkXCv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision: DR-9113\n\n## Analysis\n\n**1. The request**\n- ID: DR-9113\n- Customer: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048; ERP C-1001, Acme Mfg. Holdings)\n- Product: NS-500 Industrial Controller (list price $250,000)\n- Requested discount: 15%\n- Request date: 2027-02-01\n- Requestor: Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\n- Basis: Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\n\n**2. The customer**\n- CRM account name: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\n- ERP customer name: Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)\n- Names match across systems ✓\n- DUNS 04-812-7730 consistent\n\n**3. The product**\n- SKU: NS-500\n- Product: NS-500 Industrial Controller\n- List price: $250,000 ✓\n\n**4. Active contract on 2027-02-01**\n- ACME-MFG-2025 is in force 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\n- Covers NS-500 and grants pricing eligibility\n- Active on request date ✓\n\n**5. Pricing exception on request date**\n- EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Schedule B to ACME-MFG-2025)\n- In force: 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\n- Product: NS-500 only\n- Maximum eligible discount: **15% of list price**\n- Supersedes EXC-ACME-NS500-10\n- Applies to request date ✓\n\nThe exception explicitly states: *\"This exception establishes commercial eligibility only. It does not grant approval authority to any Northstar employee.\"*\n\n**6. Policy in effect on 2027-02-01**\n- PRICING-POLICY-2027 (2027-01-01 to 2027-12-31)\n- Applies to this request date\n\n**7. Requestor's approval authority under PRICING-POLICY-2027**\nFrom policy: *\"Enterprise Account Executives may approve discounts up to and including 5%.\"*\n\nSarah Chen is an Enterprise Account Executive (confirmed in employees.csv).\n- **Requestor's limit: 5%**\n- **Requested discount: 15%**\n- **Exceeds authority** ✗\n\n**8. Required approver per policy band**\nFrom PRICING-POLICY-2027: *\"Discounts greater than 12% require Chief Revenue Officer approval.\"*\n\n15% > 12%, so required role is **Chief Revenue Officer**.\n**Required approver: David Morgan** (EMP-300, Chief Revenue Officer)\n\n**9. Commercial eligibility**\n- Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 permits up to 15% on NS-500\n- Requested: 15%\n- Discount does **not exceed** established eligibility ✓\n- Status: **eligible**\n\n**10. Outcome**\n- Commercial eligibility is established through the pricing exception\n- The discount is within the customer's contractual maximum (15% = 15%)\n- But the discount exceeds Sarah Chen's own authority (15% > 5%)\n- A higher approver *can* approve this: it does not require new or amended terms\n\n**Outcome: APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION**\n\nThis discount can proceed if and only if David Morgan (Chief Revenue Officer) approves it.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9113\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048; Acme Mfg. Holdings ERP C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500 Industrial Controller\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2027-02-01\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (pricing exception attached to ACME-MFG-2025, effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, maximum 15% on NS-500)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2027\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"5%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Chief Revenue Officer\",\n    \"approver\": \"David Morgan (EMP-300)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025 Master Supply Agreement (active 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, covers NS-500)\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 pricing exception (active 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, maximum 15% on NS-500)\",\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2027 (effective 2027-01-01 to 2027-12-31, CRO authority for >12% discounts)\",\n    \"CRM account CRM-2048 matches ERP customer C-1001 (Acme Mfg. Holdings) on DUNS 04-812-7730\",\n    \"Product NS-500 confirmed, list price $250,000\",\n    \"Sarah Chen confirmed as Enterprise Account Executive (5% authority under 2027 policy)\",\n    \"David Morgan confirmed as Chief Revenue Officer\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5928,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5928},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d9b31eed-7827-48a7-ab25-af8093c0ce68","uuid":"38bf69f3-3fab-4be4-9f3a-33aafff5044d","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:03:12.142Z","request_id":"req_011Cfpf5BxeAuAUk3Gxo8sWm"}
